- Who is this?

333
00:23:19,789 --> 00:23:22,617
Hey, hey, hey, hey!
Drop it!

334
00:23:22,618 --> 00:23:24,489
She was in the house
when we arrived.

335
00:23:24,490 --> 00:23:26,013
High on something.

336
00:23:26,100 --> 00:23:28,363
