Control, this is 5-1-4.

391
00:26:01,690 --> 00:26:05,041
If there was a body here before,
it's not here any longer.

392
00:26:07,696 --> 00:26:08,784
Control, do you copy?

393
00:26:10,481 --> 00:26:11,831
Alright, man.
