433
00:28:46,942 --> 00:28:49,640
Do you think you have
any power here?

434
00:29:08,616 --> 00:29:10,400
- What do they want?
- Don't worry about it.

435
00:29:10,531 --> 00:29:12,751
You took something from us!

436
00:29:15,666 --> 00:29:16,798
Fuck.

437
00:29:28,244 --> 00:29:30,159
