anywhere else to go.

446
00:30:09,503 --> 00:30:12,374
I don't want them to see you.
You know how it spooks them.

447
00:30:18,120 --> 00:30:20,470
Put him down there, child.
- Okay.

448
00:30:23,822 --> 00:30:26,955
