you're above it.

459
00:31:13,436 --> 00:31:15,830
You're right.
You're right. I'm sorry.

460
00:31:19,529 --> 00:31:20,879
Now...

461
00:31:22,054 --> 00:31:23,533
Tell me what happened.

462
00:31:57,524 --> 00:31:58,917
