463
00:32:01,093 --> 00:32:02,485
What--
- You took something.

464
00:32:02,616 --> 00:32:05,314
- What did you say?
- You took something.

465
00:32:05,401 --> 00:32:06,837
You took something.

466
00:32:06,925 --> 00:32:08,709
What? What are you--

467
00:32:08,839 --> 00:32:12,713
Tabby, dear, why don't you go
