actually help them.

490
00:33:49,157 --> 00:33:51,942
Ohh!

491
00:33:52,030 --> 00:33:54,206
Holy shit.

492
00:34:01,952 --> 00:34:03,476
Um...

493
00:34:03,563 --> 00:34:06,174
