495
00:34:11,527 --> 00:34:13,312
What?

496
00:34:13,399 --> 00:34:16,054
Hey, uh, you can't be up here!

497
00:34:20,971 --> 00:34:22,669
What the fuck?

498
00:34:28,240 --> 00:34:31,939
