502
00:34:46,649 --> 00:34:48,216
What did you see?

503
00:34:50,523 --> 00:34:53,134
I saw my wife.

504
00:34:53,221 --> 00:34:55,223
Standing on our front step.

505
00:34:55,354 --> 00:34:57,443
She was waving at me.

506
00:34:58,966 --> 00:35:01,969
